(PROPOSAL: Billing Platform Migration) Tj T*
(\(Made-up sample for development. Not real client or trainee data.\)) Tj T*
(1. Summary) Tj T*
(We propose migrating the company's billing system from the legacy monolith to) Tj T*
(microservices. The programme will run for six months with a total budget of $400,000.) Tj T*
(2. Scope) Tj T*
(Phase 1 \(months 1-3\): invoicing service and customer ledger.) Tj T*
(Phase 2 \(months 4-6\): payments service, integrated with the CloudPay gateway.) Tj T*
(3. Team) Tj T*
(Three delivery teams will work in parallel: Invoicing, Payments and Platform.) Tj T*
(4. Budget) Tj T*
(The total budget is $400,000. A detailed breakdown will be shared after approval.) Tj T*
(5. Timeline) Tj T*
(All work completes within six months. Go-live is planned for the end of month six.) Tj T*
(6. Vendors) Tj T*
(CloudPay will be the only payment gateway. The contract is being finalised.) Tj T*
(7. Expected benefits) Tj T*
(Faster releases and lower maintenance effort. Benefits will be measured after go-live.) Tj T*
